            "review_title": "Review at Jollibee - Ngoc Khanh",
            "review_text": "Yunika\n93 contributions\n0\nHorrible\nAug 2018 • Couples\nJollibee here in Vietnam is such a huge disgrace to Jollibee. Horrible service whether delivery or dining in. They always forget to bring things and makes the delivery guy come back. Once it's the sundae, then whole bucket of chicken, then burger. Now went to the store to order, waited almost 30 minutes to get the order.. and guess what they forgot to put one pepsi. And now that I am home, I realized they also forgot to include 2 sundae. How can this always happen? Maybe send your crew to Philippines to have their training there? This kind of thing NEVER happens in the Philippines.. or in case they do, they give one or 2 free stuff. Here you know what I get? They even doubt THEY FORGOT IT. I don't even care if it's only once or twice. But in more than 50x I ordered from Jollibee here, there's always an issue for like maybe 25x. You also give way TOO many plastics btw!\nRead more\nWritten August 4, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
