            "review_title": "Review at Jollibee - Ngoc Khanh",
            "review_text": "Michael D\nBeijing, China14 contributions\n1\nOh My Gosh\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWent in and remembered visiting this restaurant in Manila several years ago. Expected decent fast food. Ordered some form of chicken burger. While waiting went searching for bathroom. It was apparently somewhere upstairs. There are 5 levels, all small in the typical narrow but tall Hanoi building. Finally found the toilet hidden on 4th floor, but an employee was camped out there, so no luck. Went back downstairs, waited another 15 minutes for my chicken burger. Eventually an overly microwaved burger arrived (why 20 minutes total to make, unless it was the responsibility of the toilet-bound employee to put it together, which unfortunately crossed my mind). Several employees were engaged in undecorating the Christmas tree. All in all a forgettable experience. Quality control non existent, management clearly not present, fortunate to escape without food borne illness. Avoid al all costs.\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
