            "review_text": "GKDob\nChester, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nDecent value for travellers\nFeb 2017\nWe went to jollibee on multiple occasions during our stay in Hanoi. I love chicken and the place looked clean. The chicken on the bone was a peng munch to be fair. The price was the equivalent of about £1.50 for small fries, 1 chicken (fair size) and a small drink. They accommodated to all of our needs when serving us and were very polite. \n\nWe came in at 2 minutes before closing and they served us food as if it were midday. That was very appreciated xx\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2017",
